<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Feature Importance</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="width: 300px">
    <h3>Feature Importance</h3>
    <p>Oracle's explanatory value for each column, from 0 (no useful correlation with the target) to 1 (perfect correlation). Each value is calculated independently, so the values do not add up to 1.</p>
    <p>SALARY at 0.8 and OFFICE_COLOR at 0.02? Salary has a much stronger relationship with the target; office color has almost none.</p>
    <p>Calculated with <code>DBMS_PREDICTIVE_ANALYTICS.EXPLAIN</code>, separately from the model shown in this result.</p>
</body>
</html>
